ccx_stepB
ccx_step*

# Variant binaries built with `make EXE=...` while another run holds the
# default one.  The pattern is deliberately broad: this session committed
# a 131MB executable twice, once as ccx_stepB and once as ccx_glob, and
# both times the remote's pre-receive hook caught what .gitignore and I
# did not.  Sources here are .c/.f/.h/.inc, so an extensionless ccx_* is
# always a binary.
ccx_step*
ccx_glob
